#: 0269afa2b8554264aa16fbafa980e153
msgid "Debugging Jittor programs"
msgstr "计图程序调试"

#: 4cfa3770406748c6b745441f9cedb49a
msgid ""
"Jittor executes graphs lazily and compiles operators at runtime. The "
"following diagnostics trade performance for more precise failure "
"information, so enable them only while reproducing a problem."
msgstr "计图以延迟方式执行计算图，并在运行时编译算子。下面的诊断选项会用性能换取更准确的故障信息，因此只应在复现问题时启用。"

#: 12f344d2eb6441d08a5691dfe10cb094
msgid "Find NaN and infinity values"
msgstr "定位 NaN 和无穷值"

#: 8fea01a4b8fe403fb1fb575145bcd649
msgid "Enable output checking and Python source tracing before starting the process:"
msgstr "启动进程前启用输出检查和 Python 源码追踪："

#: 6b24306878f14419978befe03a1908a4
msgid ""
"`JT_CHECK_NAN=1` stops when an operator emits an invalid floating-point "
"value. `trace_py_var=3` records the Python call site associated with "
"generated operators. Both settings trigger recompilation and add substantial"
" overhead."
msgstr ""
"`JT_CHECK_NAN=1` 会在算子输出异常浮点值时停止程序；`trace_py_var=3` 会记录生成算子对应的 Python "
"调用位置。这两个设置都会触发重新编译并带来显著开销。"

#: b9b6661c27af4edc96ab098728cd30ce
msgid "Make asynchronous failures local"
msgstr "就地定位异步错误"

#: da7b3cac64944248bab08af517a0775b
msgid ""
"Lazy execution can report an error after the Python line that created the "
"failing operator. For a small reproducer, temporarily switch to eager "
"execution:"
msgstr "延迟执行可能在创建失败算子的 Python 语句之后才报告错误。对于较小的复现程序，可暂时切换到立即执行："

#: 1833056fc6574bc388f5cbadf2ec749f
msgid "The equivalent process-local setting is:"
msgstr "等价的进程内设置是："

#: 5bc76435856c46b9bde73cac950f1b46
msgid "Diagnose memory exhaustion"
msgstr "诊断内存耗尽"

#: b87a89b631524f72a12ecf2654a074dc
msgid ""
"If one iteration exceeds available memory, first reduce the model or batch "
"size. Explicit synchronization and collection can help establish whether "
"temporary graphs are being retained:"
msgstr "如果一次迭代就超过可用内存，请先缩小模型或批大小。显式同步和回收有助于判断临时计算图是否被意外保留："

#: e089c1f4b86d41e5a569f9cca972e804
msgid ""
"For CUDA convolutions, limiting cuDNN workspace can reduce peak allocation "
"at the cost of performance:"
msgstr "对于 CUDA 卷积，限制 cuDNN 工作区可以降低峰值分配，但会牺牲性能："

#: 7330dc69e6644a7eab3336a5c9c1ce35
msgid "If memory grows across iterations, inspect graph and held-variable counts:"
msgstr "如果内存随迭代持续增长，请检查计算图和被持有变量的数量："

#: 91f3182d2e564af5bb40aec6e11a1a18
msgid ""
"An increasing `lived_var` or `lived_op` count usually indicates a retained "
"graph or a global variable that still participates in differentiation."
msgstr "`lived_var` 或 `lived_op` 持续增加，通常说明计算图被保留，或某个仍参与求导的全局变量没有释放。"

#: a4620e77cbad4919b6c95da6c9df851d
msgid "Debug a segmentation fault"
msgstr "调试段错误"

#: e8881126ec134ca0bfd19dc747028ef9
msgid "Build with debug information and attach GDB automatically:"
msgstr "使用调试信息构建，并自动附加 GDB："

#: 17985f9483d247c59399cdb83682c155
msgid ""
"Include a minimal reproducer, the complete log, compiler version, and device"
" information when reporting a native crash."
msgstr "报告原生崩溃时，请提供最小复现、完整日志、编译器版本和设备信息。"

#: c43dcc53baba46c5bc592e5678b9f6ed
msgid "Manage the compilation cache"
msgstr "管理编译缓存"

#: 6d882b814e534a3899bb27860c09e9f7
msgid ""
"Jittor stores compiled kernels, downloaded toolchains, datasets, and weights"
" in its cache directory. After a compiler, driver, or system upgrade, clear "
"all cached state with:"
msgstr "计图会在缓存目录中存放已编译内核、下载的工具链、数据集和权重。升级编译器、驱动或系统后，可用以下命令清理全部缓存状态："

#: 374baf7129e2458d8c6872e9446be81c
msgid "List narrower cleanup targets with:"
msgstr "可用以下命令查看更细粒度的清理目标："
